onta"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An e-mail","blocks":[{"type":"mail","from":"bank@mail.com","to":"ana@mail.com","subject":"Your new account","paras":["Dear Ana,","Welcome! You **must** show your ID to open the account. You **have to** make a deposit of $50. You **should** keep your PIN secret. You **could** also set up an online profile.","Please call if you have any questions. The Bank Team"],"gloss":[["deposit","depósito"],["PIN","senha"],["profile","perfil"],["secret","secreto"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"You must show your ID.","ans":"T","why":"must show your ID."},{"q":"You need a $500 deposit.","ans":"F","why":"$50."},{"q":"You could set up an online profile.","ans":"T","why":"could also set up."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“deposit” = ?","opts":["depósito","despesa","dívida"],"ans":0,"why":"deposit."},{"q":"“secret” = ?","opts":["secreto","seguro","simples"],"ans":0,"why":"secret."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Modals: contrast","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Modal","Força","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**must**","obrigação","**You must show your ID.**"],["**have to**","necessidade externa","**You have to make a deposit.**"],["**should**","conselho","**You should keep your PIN secret.**"],["**could**","opção","**You could set up a profile.**"]],"cap":"Modals: contrast"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**Must** é mais forte e subjetivo; **have to** vem de uma regra. Passado de *must/have to*: **had to**."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"You ___ show your ID. (must)","a":"must","why":"obrigação."},{"s":"You ___ make a deposit. (have to)","a":"have to","why":"regra."},{"s":"You ___ keep it secret. (should)","a":"should","why":"conselho."},{"s":"You ___ choose online. (could)","a":"could","why":"opção."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Ma